=== lcd-osd1ctl-directfb-watch.sh (mode: no-hardware) ===
Forcing pure software DirectFB rendering (no GPU/GAL surfaces at all).
Baseline (before starting DirectFB):
  OSD1_CTL=0x001660FF (format=6 rgb_order=5(stock-encoding) yuv_order=0)
  CONTROL=0x03740081 (OSD1_enabled=1)
  OSD1_ADDR=0x0F000000

Starting start_msn_directfb -- watch the screen, Ctrl-C when done (black screen or not)...
[09:24:32] OSD1_CTL=0x001660FF (format=6 rgb_order=5(stock-encoding) yuv_order=0)
[09:24:32] CONTROL=0x03740081 (OSD1_enabled=1)
[09:24:32] OSD1_ADDR=0x0F000000
[no-hardware] restored original /etc/directfbrc

